message: "If you use this software in your research, design, or manufacturing workflows, please cite it as below."
title: "MiniJersey 3D Studio: Real-Time Client-Side Cycling Jersey Customization & Dynamic Planar WebGL Renderer"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
url: "https://francescocastaldi.github.io/mini-jersey-studio/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancescoCastaldi/mini-jersey-studio"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Castaldi
