keywords:
  - threejs
  - webgl
  - cycling jersey
  - garment customization
  - planar uv projection
  - svg to canvas
  - tech pack
  - client-side web application
abstract: >-
  MiniJersey 3D Studio is an open-source, client-side web platform for real-time
  apparel design and 3D visualization. It combines dynamic SVG vector generation,
  dual-hemisphere planar UV mapping, interactive 3D WebGL rendering via Three.js,
  custom GLB/GLTF model ingestion, and production-ready 2D Tech Pack generation.
